# The repository root .gitignore excludes `lib/` and `*.png` for the Python
# projects alongside this one. Both are real source here -- lib/ holds the
# application code and the icons are required for the PWA install prompt -- so
# re-include them for this directory only.
!lib/
!public/icons/
!public/icons/*.png
.env*
